# CLI / config

- USB Serial CLI is the commissioning surface — keep commands documented in `doc/guide/cli.md`.
- Persist settings through the config filesystem; validate before commit to flash.
- Login/session required for privileged config and control writes.
- Identity strings (hostname, AP SSID prefix) must match product docs unless migrating deliberately.
- Prefer clear operator errors over silent defaults that hide miswiring.